<title>USA: Medical Graphics names Laster as CFO.</title>
<headline>Medical Graphics names Laster as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Graphics Corp, a manufacturer of non-invasive cardiorespiratory diagnostics systems, said Monday that Lawrence Laster joined the company as vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>It is a newly created position.</p>
<p>Laster previously held various senior financial positions at General Electric Co, including seven years as manager of manufacturing finance at GE's Medical Systems division.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
